1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,235
Hi friends!

2
00:00:01,235 --> 00:00:02,103
I'm Mimzi,

3
00:00:02,103 --> 00:00:03,506
and this is Teddy!

4
00:00:04,056 --> 00:00:05,185
Hi, hi!

5
00:00:05,735 --> 00:00:08,638
Let's find things around our home!

6
00:00:09,988 --> 00:00:11,964
This is a chair.

7
00:00:12,464 --> 00:00:14,641
Chair! Can you say chair?

8
00:00:16,941 --> 00:00:19,060
This is a table.

9
00:00:19,560 --> 00:00:22,081
Table! Can you say table?

10
00:00:24,381 --> 00:00:26,119
What is this?

11
00:00:27,919 --> 00:00:29,290
It's a bed!

12
00:00:29,290 --> 00:00:29,975
Bed!

13
00:00:30,525 --> 00:00:31,332
Bed!

14
00:00:32,682 --> 00:00:34,682
This is a door.

15
00:00:35,182 --> 00:00:37,399
Door! Can you say door?

16
00:00:39,699 --> 00:00:41,771
This is a window.

17
00:00:42,271 --> 00:00:44,730
Window! Can you say window?

18
00:00:47,030 --> 00:00:48,665
You're doing so well!

19
00:00:48,665 --> 00:00:50,095
Give Teddy a clap!

20
00:00:52,745 --> 00:00:54,483
What is this?

21
00:00:56,283 --> 00:00:57,611
It's a lamp!

22
00:00:57,611 --> 00:00:58,319
Lamp!

23
00:00:58,869 --> 00:00:59,696
Lamp!

24
00:01:01,046 --> 00:01:03,141
This is a sofa.

25
00:01:03,641 --> 00:01:06,181
Sofa! Can you say sofa?

26
00:01:08,481 --> 00:01:10,410
This is a clock.

27
00:01:10,910 --> 00:01:13,228
Clock! Can you say clock?

28
00:01:15,528 --> 00:01:17,266
What is this?

29
00:01:19,066 --> 00:01:20,276
It's a cup!

30
00:01:20,276 --> 00:01:20,881
Cup!

31
00:01:21,431 --> 00:01:22,157
Cup!

32
00:01:23,507 --> 00:01:25,554
This is a spoon.

33
00:01:26,054 --> 00:01:28,554
Spoon! Can you say spoon?

34
00:01:30,854 --> 00:01:32,780
Let's say them all again,

35
00:01:32,780 --> 00:01:33,949
nice and fast!

36
00:01:34,499 --> 00:01:39,016
chair, table, bed, door, window, lamp, sofa, clock, cup, spoon!

37
00:01:40,416 --> 00:01:43,359
Hooray! We learned so many words!

38
00:01:43,909 --> 00:01:46,147
Great job, little learner!

39
00:01:46,697 --> 00:01:48,586
Share Mimzi with a friend,

40
00:01:48,586 --> 00:01:51,126
and subscribe for more learning fun!

41
00:01:51,676 --> 00:01:52,525
Next time,

42
00:01:52,525 --> 00:01:54,094
let's practice hello,

43
00:01:54,094 --> 00:01:55,728
goodbye and thank you.

44
00:01:55,978 --> 00:01:57,349
Bye bye!
